Package: buscalogo-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libappindicator3-1 | libayatana-appindicator3-1, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Recommends: libnss3-tools
Maintainer: BuscaLogo <contato@buscalogo.com>
Description: BuscaLogo Agent
 Agente local para hospedagem de sites .bl, DNS CoreDNS,
 Yggdrasil, CouchDB, scraper e painel de gerenciamento.
 Inclui interface desktop nativa (Neutralinojs).
 Instala a CA raiz no sistema e (com libnss3-tools) no NSS
 de Firefox/Chrome/Brave para HTTPS .bl/.lo.
